","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you call methods that use random data, such as creating new random"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values or shuffling a collection, you can pass a "},{"code":"RandomNumberGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"type to be used as the source for randomness. When you don’t pass a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generator, the default "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SystemRandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" type is used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When providing new APIs that use randomness, provide a version that accepts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a generator conforming to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol as well as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version that uses the default system generator. For example, this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Weekday"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"enumeration provides static methods that return a random day of the week:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["enum Weekday: CaseIterable {","    case sunday, monday, tuesday, wednesday, thursday, friday, saturday","","    static func random<G: RandomNumberGenerator>(using generator: inout G) -> Weekday {","        return Weekday.allCases.randomElement(using: &generator)!","    }","","    static func random() -> Weekday {","        var g = SystemRandomNumberGenerator()","        return Weekday.random(using: &g)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":1,"text":"Conforming to the RandomNumberGenerator Protocol","anchor":"Conforming-to-the-RandomNumberGenerator-Protocol","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A custom "},{"code":"RandomNumberGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type can have different characteristics"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the default "},{"code":"SystemRandomNumberGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type. For example, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"seedable generator can be used to generate a repeatable sequence of random"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values for testing purposes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To make a custom type conform to the "},{"code":"RandomNumberGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implement the required "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"next()"},{"type":"text","text":" method. Each call to "},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must produce"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a uniform and independent random value.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Types that conform to "},{"code":"RandomNumberGenerator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" should specifically document","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the thread safety and quality of the generator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RandomNumberGenerator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Generating Random Binary Data","anchor":"Generating-Random-Binary-Data","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RandomNumberGenerator\/next()","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/RandomNumberGenerator\/next(upperBound:)"]}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/RandomNumberGenerator":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/randomnumbergenerator","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomNumberG